  "short_description": "<p>Handwoven bamboo pendant lights from Vietnam. Sustainable, eco-friendly, and made for wholesale supply. Perfect for modern interiors, hotels, and resorts.</p>",
  "description": "<p data-start=\"158\" data-end=\"555\"><strong data-start=\"158\" data-end=\"181\">Product Description</strong><br data-start=\"181\" data-end=\"184\" />Our <strong data-start=\"188\" data-end=\"213\">bamboo pendant lights</strong> are handcrafted by skilled Vietnamese artisans, using eco-friendly and renewable bamboo. Each lamp is carefully woven to create natural beauty while providing warm and soft lighting for any interior. These pendant lights are not only decorative but also sustainable, making them ideal for hotels, restaurants, resorts, and home decoration.</p>\n<p data-start=\"557\" data-end=\"835\">As a <strong data-start=\"562\" data-end=\"614\">trusted bamboo pendant light supplier in Vietnam</strong>, we provide wholesale solutions for importers, distributors, and retailers worldwide. With a wide variety of shapes and finishes, our lights bring a touch of nature and cultural craftsmanship into modern living spaces.</p>\n<p data-start=\"557\" data-end=\"835\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-1135\" src=\"https://vietcraft.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Bamboo-pedant-light-manufacturer-in-Vietnam-1128x800.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1020\" height=\"723\" /></p>\n<p data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"855\"><strong data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"853\">Key Features</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"856\" data-end=\"1132\">\n<li data-start=\"856\" data-end=\"919\">\n<p data-start=\"858\" data-end=\"919\">Material: 100% natural bamboo, eco-friendly and sustainable</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"920\" data-end=\"956\">\n<p data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"956\">Handwoven by Vietnamese artisans</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"1006\">\n<p data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"1006\">Lightweight, durable, and safe for indoor use</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1007\" data-end=\"1060\">\n<p data-start=\"1009\" data-end=\"1060\">Available in multiple sizes, shapes, and finishes</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1132\">\n<p data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1132\">Suitable for living rooms, dining areas, cafes, hotels, and resorts</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1639\" data-end=\"1717\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1133\" src=\"https://vietcraft.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Bamboo-lamphade-factory-in-Vietnam.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"784\" /></p>\n<hr data-start=\"1719\" data-end=\"1722\" />\n<p data-start=\"1724\" data-end=\"1994\">✨ Supplier &amp; Manufacturer in Vietnam:<br data-start=\"1761\" data-end=\"1764\" />We provide high-quality, handcrafted <strong data-start=\"1801\" data-end=\"1826\">bamboo pendant lights</strong> directly from Vietnam, offering bulk and wholesale options for retailers, decorators, and importers. For inquiries, please contact us at <strong data-start=\"1964\" data-end=\"1991\"><a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1966\" data-end=\"1989\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com</a></strong>.</p>",
